WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.167
Top commanders

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:01.801
say Russian

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.336
forces are increasing

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:04.938
their attacks on Bakhmut

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.673
as the Ukrainian military remains

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.208
determined to keep Russia

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:10.710
from capturing the city by Tuesday.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.912
When Moscow holds its World

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:14.714
War to Victory Day Parade.

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:15.648
Now, Ukraine says

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:17.684
Russia is doing everything possible

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:18.985
to take back,

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:21.054
including sending in more forces.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.357
And those forces include their fighters.

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.158
Just days ago,

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:26.526
the head of the Russian mercenary group

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:27.027
had threatened

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.995
to pull his man out of the fight

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:31.097
because of a lack of ammunition.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:32.132
He now claims

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:33.433
his fighters are advancing

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.735
and as they wait for more supplies.

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:36.803
CNN's Sam

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:40.740
Kiley has our update now from Kiev.

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:41.741
Fighting continues

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.443
to be bloody and merciless

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.478
in the east of the country, in particular

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:47.647
around the city of parliament,

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.449
where the Ukrainians have suggested

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.650
that it's possible

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.152
that the Wagner group

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:52.786
or elements

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:54.020
supporting the fighting group

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.255
have even been using

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:57.457
incendiary devices in that battle.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.359
This coming as the leader

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:00.727
of the mercenary organization

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:01.561
is backtracked

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:02.629
on his threat

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:03.663
to leave the city

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.532
and hand over to Chechen fighters.

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:06.766
This is very much part

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.235
of an ongoing soap opera, effectively

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:10.403
led by Mr.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.071
Prigozhin,

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.906
who has been tweeting

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.841
and making public statements

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:15.575
since effectively

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.609
the beginning of this war.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.011
Highly critical of the Kremlin

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.112
and particularly

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.513
the Russian Ministry of Defense.

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:21.748
He now says that he is getting

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.316
the ammunition that he needs

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:25.485
so he won't be pulling his troops out

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:26.753
for the foreseeable future.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:29.823
But all eyes really are on where and when

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:31.291
or even if the Ukrainians

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.459
are going to be launching

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:33.693
a summer offensive.

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.428
There have been mass troop movements.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.629
There is a lot of talk

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:37.764
from the Ukrainians

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:38.731
about an offensive,

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.233
but no real signs yet

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.401
on the ground

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:43.570
that anything is especially imminent.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:46.172
Sam Kiley, CNN, in Kiev.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:49.976
Joining me now from Washington,

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:50.910
retired US

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.412
Air Force colonel and CNN

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:54.481
military analyst Cedric Leighton.

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.182
Good to have you weigh in on

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:57.183
these issues.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.152
We've had quite a few days, though,

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:00.820
Wagner and group leader,

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.122
he made those dramatic threats

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:02.989
to pull out of BUK.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.991
Much turned out

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:06.192
it was quite a performance.

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:08.828
Right.
It looks like his troops are staying put.

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:10.463
Does this incident

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:13.199
give you any insight into what's going on

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:14.000
with either

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:14.968
the volunteer group

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.970
or the Russian military?

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:20.140
Well, Paula, I think it's

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:20.540
you know, it's

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.575
kind of the battle of the tantrums,

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:23.143
if you will.

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:24.777
And in this particular case,

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:26.479
Ghosn's tantrum

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:28.248
seems to have won the day for him.

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:28.915
In other words,

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:31.417
he gets to get weapons and ammunition,

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:34.287
gets a resupply line to,

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:35.522
you know, his troops in Bermuda.

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:37.090
That didn't appear

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.826
to have that good of a resupply line.

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:42.228
And he gets to stay in that

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:43.463
horrible meat grinder.

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:44.964
So in some ways, you know,

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:45.865
it might

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:48.201
be considered a victory for pragmatism,

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:49.002
but in other ways, it's

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:50.970
a Pyrrhic victory because,

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.405
you know, staying in that meat grinder,

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:52.772
it doesn't

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:53.339
do anybody

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:55.808
any favors and least of all him.

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:56.676
Yeah.
But there seemed

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.678
when I say that it's a poor performance.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.914
I'm not trying to be trite.

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.081
It seemed that

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:03.850
it was a message to someone.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.852
And yet if you think all he wanted from

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:06.986
that was ammunition, well,

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:07.620
that would be pretty

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.522
naive to think that it was clearly some

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:10.790
kind of propaganda purpose.

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:13.059
Absolutely.

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:13.960
Well, there is propaganda

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.061
and there's a power struggle

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:15.995
going on, Paula.

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:18.932
And what this basically means to me

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:22.001
is that Prigozhin let it be known

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:24.737
that he has a military element

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.139
that could be withdrawn

00:03:26.139 --> 00:03:28.308
and could potentially put at risk

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:31.144
Russia's front line.

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:32.779
And if that front line had collapsed,

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:34.347
that would have been a calamity

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:36.182
where the Russian forces

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:38.351
So what Prigozhin is doing

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:40.787
is he's flexing his muscles in a way.

00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:43.690
He is in a position where he can,

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.160
in essence, complain and make sure that

00:03:47.427 --> 00:03:48.528
he gets

00:03:48.528 --> 00:03:50.263
what he wants in this particular case.

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:52.298
But he is basically vying

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:53.666
for as much power as he can

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:57.770
possibly get right And that gives us turn

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:58.905
turns our attention now

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:00.907
to Ukraine's counter offensive.

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:02.909
It could start as early as this week.

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:04.611
Do you think expectations are too high

00:04:04.611 --> 00:04:05.144
at this point,

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:07.680
especially if what Ukraine is looking for

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.950
is a decisive blow to the Russian

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:11.918
military in this war?

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:13.653
Yeah, if you're

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:14.654
going to mount

00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:17.090
a decisive blow in an operation like this

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.158
or in a conflict like this,

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:21.327
there's got to be an element of surprise

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:21.661
here.

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:22.595
And, you know,

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:23.096
right now,

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:26.332
it seems to me at least that we have

00:04:26.866 --> 00:04:28.001
telegraphed way too much.

00:04:28.001 --> 00:04:29.502
The Ukrainians have telegraphed

00:04:29.502 --> 00:04:30.036
way too much.

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:31.104
The West has telegraphed

00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:32.005
way too much

00:04:32.005 --> 00:04:34.407
that this offensive is going to happen.

00:04:34.407 --> 00:04:36.075
And the only thing that's

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:37.877
just ignoring the specific details

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:39.579
as to time and place.

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:40.847
But we believe it's going to happen

00:04:40.847 --> 00:04:41.314
this week.

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:43.383
We believe it's going to happen

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:45.952
probably in the south and we believe it's

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:48.855
going to affect the approaches to Crimea.

00:04:49.322 --> 00:04:50.823
So that is

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:51.691
a major area

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:52.258
that shouldn't be

00:04:52.258 --> 00:04:54.360
a big surprise to the Russians.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.663
But if the Ukrainians have learned

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:57.964
mobility warfare,

00:04:57.964 --> 00:04:59.666
if they've learned combined arms

00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:01.034
operations,

00:05:01.034 --> 00:05:02.068
putting all the elements

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:03.503
of a military force

00:05:03.503 --> 00:05:05.805
together in a coordinated fashion,

00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:06.306
then they could

00:05:06.306 --> 00:05:07.740
still achieve some successes,

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.275
but they won't be as dramatic

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:10.176
as they would have been

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:12.512
had there been the element of surprise.

00:05:12.512 --> 00:05:13.613
Yeah, it's such a good point. Right?

00:05:13.613 --> 00:05:15.181
We've been talking about this for months,

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:16.149
it seems now.

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:17.750
And I have to ask you strategically,

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.519
the US, the allies, have they given

00:05:19.519 --> 00:05:21.721
Ukraine enough capability at this point?

00:05:21.921 --> 00:05:23.456
And has it arrived in time

00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:26.826
Well, it's mixed.

00:05:26.826 --> 00:05:27.727
You know, the verdict on

00:05:27.727 --> 00:05:29.095
that is definitely mixed.

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:29.862
I think

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:31.664
that some of the capabilities,

00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:33.333
such as the Patriot missile system

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:35.101
which reportedly has shot down

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:37.303
a commercial hypersonic missile,

00:05:37.303 --> 00:05:40.340
that's a major plus for the Ukrainians.

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:41.240
However,

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.142
they're only going to be two batteries

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:45.511
two Patriot batteries in Ukraine.

00:05:45.511 --> 00:05:47.113
They will need far more than that

00:05:47.113 --> 00:05:48.181
in order to mount

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:49.449
an effective

00:05:49.449 --> 00:05:51.050
air defense and missile defense

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.285
for their country.

00:05:52.285 --> 00:05:54.287
And the other thing that, of course, is

00:05:54.287 --> 00:05:55.521
missing is

00:05:55.521 --> 00:05:57.256
required quantity of tanks

00:05:57.256 --> 00:05:59.359
and, of course, aircraft.

00:05:59.359 --> 00:06:01.060
The Ukrainians want the M16.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.462
They're not getting the F-16

00:06:02.462 --> 00:06:04.697
until after all of this is done,

00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:05.531
if at all.

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:07.800
And that, of course, will provide them

00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:10.837
with a significant

00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:12.071
lack of capability

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:13.272
at this particular point.

00:06:13.272 --> 00:06:14.340
And that could have

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.408
a significant impact

00:06:15.408 --> 00:06:17.410
on their ability to perform.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:18.244
Yeah.
And it'll be interesting

00:06:18.244 --> 00:06:18.611
to see

00:06:18.611 --> 00:06:20.313
what the blowback is from Ukraine,

00:06:20.313 --> 00:06:22.081
if and when that happens.

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:23.649
Again, some pivotal months

00:06:23.649 --> 00:06:24.517
ahead for sure.

00:06:24.517 --> 00:06:26.352
As the weather warms up in Ukraine.

00:06:26.352 --> 00:06:27.153
Retired U.S.

00:06:27.153 --> 00:06:28.020
Air Force Colonel Cedric

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:28.721
Leighton, thanks so much.

00:06:28.721 --> 00:06:29.455
Really appreciate it.

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:30.823
And what's the latest

00:06:30.823 --> 00:06:33.626
on the strikes Nick, and the presence

00:06:34.293 --> 00:06:36.396
of Russian forces in battle much as well.

00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:37.797
Some question about that in the weekend.

00:06:40.199 --> 00:06:41.567
Yes, certainly

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:43.503
the Eastern Front continues

00:06:43.503 --> 00:06:44.737
to be very active.

00:06:44.737 --> 00:06:46.038
Where we're standing here,

00:06:46.038 --> 00:06:48.241
we can hear the sounds of artillery

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:49.675
quite clearly.

00:06:49.675 --> 00:06:50.777
In the distance here.

00:06:50.777 --> 00:06:52.412
So the east is very active.

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:54.247
And of course, particularly, in fact,

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:56.416
Ukrainian officials and military

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:58.184
are concerned about the potential

00:06:58.184 --> 00:07:00.553
of a Russian push at the last minute

00:07:00.553 --> 00:07:02.722
to try to take control of it completely

00:07:02.955 --> 00:07:04.090
before those victory day

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:06.826
parades in Moscow on or

00:07:06.826 --> 00:07:08.327
on the 9th of May tomorrow.

00:07:08.327 --> 00:07:09.695
So there is,

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:10.296
if you will,

00:07:10.296 --> 00:07:11.798
perhaps a little more tension

00:07:11.798 --> 00:07:13.399
along the front lines in the east

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:15.468
about Russia and Russia's intent.

00:07:15.701 --> 00:07:16.269
But, of course,

00:07:16.269 --> 00:07:18.037
all of that will be

00:07:18.037 --> 00:07:19.672
will be valuable information

00:07:19.672 --> 00:07:21.040
for the Ukrainians

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.775
so that they can sort of determine

00:07:22.775 --> 00:07:24.877
if the Russians make a big last minute

00:07:24.877 --> 00:07:26.379
push for back.

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:27.580
How strong is it

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.048
where their strengths,

00:07:29.048 --> 00:07:30.616
where the weaknesses

00:07:30.616 --> 00:07:33.052
are along the southern front?

00:07:33.052 --> 00:07:35.988
Again, the much expected possible

00:07:38.391 --> 00:07:39.792
offensive that

00:07:39.792 --> 00:07:40.860
the government

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:41.661
officials sometimes

00:07:41.661 --> 00:07:44.030
call a military campaign here,

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.631
that Russian expectation

00:07:45.631 --> 00:07:46.732
is that that's perhaps

00:07:46.732 --> 00:07:48.835
going to get underway sometime soon.

00:07:48.835 --> 00:07:51.003
No indication from Ukrainian officials

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:53.039
about when or where that may start.

00:07:53.372 --> 00:07:55.608
But the strikes on Kiev, significant

00:07:55.608 --> 00:07:57.977
perhaps in the number 35 drones,

00:07:57.977 --> 00:07:59.345
that was a significant number

00:07:59.345 --> 00:08:00.847
significant for the Ukrainians

00:08:00.847 --> 00:08:01.380
that they were able

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.216
to shoot them all down and

00:08:03.216 --> 00:08:06.853
some missiles getting through in Odessa.

00:08:06.886 --> 00:08:08.421
Again, it's key

00:08:08.421 --> 00:08:09.989
that seems to have the strongest

00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:10.656
air defenses.

00:08:10.656 --> 00:08:11.924
We've heard Ukrainian officials

00:08:11.924 --> 00:08:13.226
say that they think

00:08:13.226 --> 00:08:14.293
that recently Russia

00:08:14.293 --> 00:08:15.962
has been testing their air

00:08:15.962 --> 00:08:18.931
defenses to see where their weaknesses

00:08:19.165 --> 00:08:19.899
could be.

00:08:19.899 --> 00:08:21.601
But in the east, where we are

00:08:21.601 --> 00:08:23.002
very distinctive,

00:08:23.002 --> 00:08:25.905
heavy shelling continue continuing.

00:08:25.905 --> 00:08:27.273
Nick in the east, thank you.

00:08:27.273 --> 00:08:28.174
And clear,

00:08:28.174 --> 00:08:30.543
we have Russia's victory day

00:08:30.543 --> 00:08:32.478
coming up tomorrow.

00:08:32.478 --> 00:08:34.780
The propaganda parallels for Russia

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:35.748
are quite strong

00:08:35.748 --> 00:08:38.017
because this was marking 1945

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:39.519
the Soviet defeat of the Nazis.

00:08:39.519 --> 00:08:41.721
And they've been alleging the pretext

00:08:41.721 --> 00:08:42.989
for their invasion of Ukraine

00:08:42.989 --> 00:08:44.290
were Nazi elements

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.659
and a new kind of fascism in Ukraine.

00:08:47.159 --> 00:08:48.861
Given that it's so many months on

00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:49.462
and Russia still

00:08:49.462 --> 00:08:50.763
hasn't got the decisive victory

00:08:50.763 --> 00:08:52.098
it promised at the beginning,

00:08:52.098 --> 00:08:53.666
what's the importance of this

00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:54.634
in terms of morale

00:08:54.634 --> 00:08:56.369
and propaganda in the country?

00:08:56.369 --> 00:08:57.270
So a victory day,

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.071
I mean, you just cannot overstate

00:08:59.071 --> 00:09:00.006
its importance in Russia.

00:09:00.006 --> 00:09:00.840
It is probably the

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:02.074
biggest day of the year.

00:09:02.074 --> 00:09:03.042
It used to be, by the way,

00:09:03.042 --> 00:09:03.876
something that

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:05.511
Russia marked in conjunction

00:09:05.511 --> 00:09:06.178
with the West was

00:09:06.178 --> 00:09:07.346
they fought together

00:09:07.346 --> 00:09:08.281
against Nazi Germany.

00:09:08.281 --> 00:09:09.448
I was there in 2005

00:09:09.448 --> 00:09:11.450
that ages me a little bit, but

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.286
that was in the US president at the time.

00:09:13.286 --> 00:09:14.554
George W Bush also attended

00:09:14.554 --> 00:09:16.022
it was the 60th anniversary.

00:09:16.022 --> 00:09:17.757
2010 Western troops

00:09:17.757 --> 00:09:19.759
even marched alongside Russian troops

00:09:20.226 --> 00:09:21.727
in that parade in Moscow.

00:09:21.727 --> 00:09:22.895
So we see obviously in play

00:09:22.895 --> 00:09:24.597
the complete destruction of Russia's

00:09:24.597 --> 00:09:25.464
relations with the West.

00:09:25.464 --> 00:09:26.666
No foreign leaders there.

00:09:26.666 --> 00:09:28.868
But I think really significant this year

00:09:28.868 --> 00:09:30.036
is that there's been some scaling

00:09:30.036 --> 00:09:32.104
back of the Victory Day parade.

00:09:32.104 --> 00:09:33.906
We've seen a lot of regions, particularly

00:09:33.906 --> 00:09:36.175
the ones closest to Ukraine, either

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:37.376
canceling parades

00:09:37.376 --> 00:09:38.945
or removing some element,

00:09:38.945 --> 00:09:40.846
things like fireworks displays,

00:09:40.846 --> 00:09:42.281
citing security concerns,

00:09:42.281 --> 00:09:43.382
in some cases, others

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:45.251
citing proximity to Ukraine.

00:09:45.251 --> 00:09:46.018
One particular

00:09:46.018 --> 00:09:46.485
region said

00:09:46.485 --> 00:09:47.353
that they didn't have

00:09:47.353 --> 00:09:49.255
military units or equipment.

00:09:49.255 --> 00:09:50.623
So that is potentially telling.

00:09:50.623 --> 00:09:52.558
And I think this is just one more way in

00:09:52.558 --> 00:09:53.826
which this war

00:09:53.826 --> 00:09:54.860
is really hitting home

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:55.194
and hitting

00:09:55.194 --> 00:09:55.828
where it hurts

00:09:55.828 --> 00:09:57.964
because this is a huge patriotic

00:09:57.964 --> 00:09:59.165
importance to Russians.

00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:01.434
Sebastian, thank you so much.

